{
  "$defs": {
    "DegradedEpisodeKey": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "来源不提供稳定产品 ID 时的退化键：`(venue, instrument_type, symbol, tradable_from)`。\n\n`basis` 显式标注这是退化身份，不能假装有稳定 ID。`tradable_from` 是该 episode 第一段可交易区间的\n起点，因此 symbol 复用（同名、不同起点）自然形成不同 episode；无稳定 ID 的改名同样形成新\nepisode，由 `ListingRevision.renamed_from` 记录与旧 episode 的关联。起点被来源更正时也只能形成新\nepisode 并写质量事件，不猜测合并（ADR-0024「失败与恢复语义」）。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.4.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "basis": {
          "const": "degraded_symbol_start",
          "title": "Basis",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "venue": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Venue",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "instrument_type": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/InstrumentType"
        },
        "symbol": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Symbol",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "tradable_from": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Tradable From",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "basis",
        "venue",
        "instrument_type",
        "symbol",
        "tradable_from"
      ],
      "title": "DegradedEpisodeKey",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "InstrumentType": {
      "enum": [
        "spot",
        "perpetual",
        "future",
        "option"
      ],
      "title": "InstrumentType",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "PolicyBinding": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "对一份版本化规则的绑定：`policy_id` + SemVer + 内容哈希（03-data.md §7.3）。\n\n`role` 区分 availability policy、precedence policy、PIT 选择规则与 parser 版本；使用处按字段\n要求确切的 `role`，因此 availability 与 precedence 绑定不能互相冒充。\n\n**诚实边界**：只约束形状。该版本是否已登记、`policy_hash` 是否等于该版本的真实内容、\npolicy 是否带有已审阅的来源证据，属未来 Registry（03-data.md §7.3「标识符冻结 ≠ 数据可信」）。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.4.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "role": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/PolicyRole"
        },
        "policy_id": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_-]*(?:\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_-]*)*$",
          "title": "Policy Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "version": {
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "policy_hash": {
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "title": "Policy Hash",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "role",
        "policy_id",
        "version",
        "policy_hash"
      ],
      "title": "PolicyBinding",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "PolicyRole": {
      "description": "一条绑定所约束的规则类别；同一形状的绑定按类别分别使用、不可互换。",
      "enum": [
        "availability",
        "precedence",
        "point_in_time",
        "parser"
      ],
      "title": "PolicyRole",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "StableEpisodeKey": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "以 venue 原生稳定产品 ID 标识的 episode：`(venue, instrument_type, venue_product_id)`。\n\nsymbol 改名仍属同一 episode（symbol 不在键内，由各 revision 的 `instrument.symbol` 记录变化）。\n`instrument_type` 在键内：venue 的产品 ID 命名空间可能按市场类型区分。\n\n`basis` 是来源声明：产品 ID 的字符串值可以恰好等于某时刻的 symbol，契约不从字符串相等推断冒充。\n\n**诚实边界**：来源是否真的提供了稳定 ID、该 ID 是否真的跨改名不变，属未来 Collector / Registry /\n质量证据，契约层无法证明。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.4.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "basis": {
          "const": "stable_product_id",
          "title": "Basis",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "venue": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Venue",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "instrument_type": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/InstrumentType"
        },
        "venue_product_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Venue Product Id",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "basis",
        "venue",
        "instrument_type",
        "venue_product_id"
      ],
      "title": "StableEpisodeKey",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "最终成员清单中的一项：episode + 决定它入选的 listing revision（PIT 选出的唯一 head）。\n\n单点 simulation 时不带生效区间；simulation 为区间时必须带 UTC 半开生效区间\n`[effective_from, effective_until)`，且落在 simulation 区间内（由 manifest 校验）。",
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "default": "2.4.0",
      "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "episode": {
      "discriminator": {
        "mapping": {
          "degraded_symbol_start": "#/$defs/DegradedEpisodeKey",
          "stable_product_id": "#/$defs/StableEpisodeKey"
        },
        "propertyName": "basis"
      },
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/StableEpisodeKey"
        },
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/DegradedEpisodeKey"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Episode"
    },
    "listing_revision_id": {
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Listing Revision Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "effective_from": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "format": "date-time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Effective From"
    },
    "effective_until": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "format": "date-time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Effective Until"
    },
    "assumption": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/PolicyBinding"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "episode",
    "listing_revision_id"
  ],
  "title": "UniverseMember",
  "type": "object"
}
